ht everybody's quick to judge  something that they're not that they're  not familiar with  so i feel like with my music and my  sound um  i've really i feel like i've done a  pretty decent job  um kind of separating myself from uh  from the pack so the transition has been  in in  terms of the industry has been right out  the gate i was accepted right up  i think it was exciting that something  new um was coming up

